 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Can we talk?\" Kseniya doesn't wait for an answer. \"We need to discuss how things are run here.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Help me haul something back? Too much for one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "You walk to the cache spot with Kseniya. Nothing much there — but they talk the whole way, and you learn the shape of them a little better."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"This one — Fly Agaric. Leaf, stem, smell. You won't forget it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"a spring that runs clear — I'll show you on the map sometime. It's real.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "Kseniya looks at you, level. \"I told you the truth. You can keep poking it, but it's told.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Finally. I was wondering when you'd see my value.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "You show them Dandelion — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Teach me something. Anything you know that I don't.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"All right. Show me when we work together.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"I'd like to learn something I can use today. Show me while you work, when you have a moment.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Still on teaching them something.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want? You know?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Kevin is gone and the world just... continues. That's the part I can't stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"I should go. You know where to find me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Are you going to stay? With us. For real.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "Something eases in their shoulders. \"Good. We're better with you here. I mean that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"I stay where I'm useful. Right now that's here. Columbus, Ohio is a direction, not a plan. Here is a plan, even if it's a hard one. Seen worse.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Well. Still on whether you're staying.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"...Fine. This had better be worth it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"Since Kevin died... I keep expecting to see Kevin at the fire. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Sleep's gone strange. I count portions out loud before eating at odd hours now. Whatever gets me to morning.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Nobody says Kevin's name right yet. We will. Give it a few days.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "You show them Dandelion — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory. \"Good to know. Really good to know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"About that question — What do you make of all this? Really.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Mm. Bleak. Probably true. I keep looking for the part where it's not.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "The ease drains out of it, a little."
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Between us — Still on what you make of all this.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"Huh. I answered that once — back when the answer was simpler.\" \"Kevin owed me a favor. I keep thinking about collecting. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"That's... pretty much all of it, honestly.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"You're a good listener, you know that?\" A tired smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "You show them Burdock — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"I should go before I say something sincere.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"About the pantry run — I still haven't found anyone. Any chance?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"I did the count twice. The count doesn't change. Nobody's worked the north treeline by the fallen oak in days. We'll fill packs before dark.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "There is no playable joint foraging outing yet. Giving food does not perform the promised outing."
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"I dreamed Kevin was still here. Woke up angry at the dream. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Someone should watch your back. Might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Walk with me? I want another pair of eyes on something.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "It's quiet at the tree line. Ada doesn't say much. Sometimes that's the whole point."
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"I sharpen sticks down to nothing. It doesn't bring anyone back. It just keeps my hands from shaking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Okay. We'll pick this up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Is there someone here you don't trust? Be honest.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "Their eyes flick, just for a second, toward the fire. \"Noted. I'll watch too.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"I don't distrust anyone exactly — I just haven't finished trusting most of them yet. There's a difference. A slow one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Still on who you don't trust.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Not right now. I've got my own things to handle.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Everyone's choosing sides and pretending they aren't. I hate it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "You show them Dandelion — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"I eat fast and leave early. Not hiding. Just — scheduling.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Alright — I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Can I tell you something? I've been sneaking out at night. I'm ashamed and I can't stop. — or so they tell me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Come see what I found. You won't believe it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "On the way, Patricia stops and actually teaches you something — how they read a slope for water, how their grandmother did it. (Knowledge, freely given. The Codex notes it.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Still on their secret.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"...Anyway. What did you want to ask?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"You feel that? The air before a storm. That's the village right now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Can we talk?\" Patricia sits down near you. \"Just... talk. Like people used to.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "They light up a little when they see you."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Can I be honest? I keep dreaming about rows of pods. Humming. Tell me I'm not the only one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up? Funny how that works.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"Last time things were different. They always are.\" \"They took Mia — Gauntlet, on the screens. The whole fire watched. Nobody knew where to look.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Sure — Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Thanks for listening. Most people change the subject.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"It's been a while. Glad we circled back to what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"I tried the Dandelion like you showed me. Didn't poison anyone, so that's a win.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Come see what I found. You won't believe it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "You walk to the hollow with Kseniya. Nothing much there — but they talk the whole way, and you learn the shape of them a little better."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"a burned farmhouse — I'll show you on the map sometime. It's real.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Still on that plant lesson. Just... be straight with me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Sure — what's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"Gauntlet. They just... took Mia. Came back like nothing happened. It wasn't nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Same as always: we endure.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"...Actually, forget it.\""
  }
 ],
